    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald welcomes to the market, 103A Cherryfield Road. A fantastic and spacious 4-bedroom detached home situated in the heart of this mature residential neighbourhood. It boasts an impressive garden to the rear and has an additional reception room currently used as a 5th bedroom.\n\nThis impressive property provides the perfect canvas for the discerning purchaser to create a modern family home in a superb location. The accommodation downstairs comprises of porch, entrance hallway, living room, dining room, kitchen, playroom/bedroom, shower room, utility room, and a downstairs WC completes the ground floor. Upstairs there are 4 bedrooms (3 doubles, 1 single) and a family bathroom completing the accommodation.\n\nTo the rear the private and spacious southwest facing garden is perfect for enjoying those long summer days. To the front, the driveway provides ample off-street parking for multiple cars. \n\nThe location is second to none, nestled within a mature setting and in very close proximity to a selection of well-established junior and senior schools. The area has a wide variety of convenience stores and is within walking distance of the Ashleaf Shopping centre, Crumlin Village and the Walkinstown roundabout. The area is well serviced by frequent and dependable bus routes and the property also enjoys the added bonus of easy access to the M50 motor way network while the Dublin Airport is a 20-minute drive approx"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.81m x 4.98m\nParquet flooring and under stairs storage.\n\nLiving Room - 3.77m x 8.29m\nCarpet flooring.\n\nDining Room - 4.46m x 2.41m\nLinly flooring.\n\nShower Room - 1.41m x 1.95m\nTiled floor with bath and shower.\n\nKitchen - 3.01m x 4.21m\nFloor and wall mount units, PowerPoint oven/hob, dishwasher, Reko fridge and freezer.\n\nPlayroom/ Bedroom 5 - 2.36m x 5.04m\nTimber, fitted wardrobe and radiator cover.\n\nWC - 1.41m x 1.02m\nWC and wash hand basin.\n\nUtility Room - 3.08m x 3.98m\nHot Point dryer, Reko washing machine and built-in units.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.18m x 4.21m\nDouble room overlooking rear garden, fitted wardrobes and timber laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.18m x 4.01m\nCarpet flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.18m x 4.22m\nCarpet flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.47m x 2.83m\nCarpet flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.54m x 2.41m\nWC, wash hand basin, shower cubicle, chrome towel rad and mirror cabinet.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>G.F.C.H</li><li>Triple Glazed windows </li><li>Partially converted attic perfect to add in an additonal reception room/ study </li><li>South west facing rear garden</li><li>Ample out street parking to the front</li><li>Detached 4/5 bedroom home</li><li>Close to a host of local schools and amenities</ul>"
      },
